<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">2 TESALONIK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wa mviaal ola baal a Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wa mviaal ola baal a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="imt1">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan a Pool wa mviaal wu ol'andoo ba Tesalonik, Silas bwɛn Timote áwueel a ndɛ m'oswɛn o ndɛ. Ke mbee a ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃kwel, lio k'ebwel bibi wɛ, ŋ'ákel ɔ̃nkaan wa mviaal wu, ŋ'ébvɔɔn andoo ange-atyel ke bviil li Kolɛ̃nte sua ɔ̃bvu wu ãku-ãtaan y'ɔ̃mɔ (51) wuo wu ãku-ãtaan ye mviaal (52).</para>
  <para style="ip">M'ɔ̃nkaan wu, Pool awa akiool mpɛn k'akal y'osɛ-mwiĩ onse ãmpal m'atuaal bɔ. Ndɛ awa bɔ luo k'asal tiil oya o Mfam Yeso.</para>
  <para style="io">Pool abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn kɛn a ŋ'obveel me ndɔɔ a akiool a Tesalonik, me ndɔɔ a okiool o bɔ, ye dzii e bɔ y'osɛ-mwiĩ o bɔ onse ãmpal m'aketuaal bɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-12">1.1-12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ke swɔɔ li mbuaal (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-11">2.1-11</ref></char>), Pool oyɛɛl akiool otsɛn me ndɔɔ obvool o Yesu Mãsia, ke ngwel wɛ andoo ba Tesalonik bakyɛ ŋ'émwɛɛn bɔ ãmpal m'aketuaal bɔ, bɔ ákeyɛɛn ndiri tsoo li etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ a baal ŋ'em'etɔ.</para>
  <para style="io">Pool bu ayɛɛn bɔ ndiri, ye k'etɔ tsoo olɔ, ebvaan tsɔɔn ŋ'ɛ̃kwel «mbuul wu ɔ̃bi» àpal. «Ndɛ ondɛ ɔ̃taal, wu akieel ayɛɛn obi m'eluɔ bvieel bvii ngel, eluɔ bvieel bvi ebelweel baal» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 2:3-4">2.3-4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io">Ke mbee a ŋ'éluɔɔn Pool akiool k'abuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-5">3.1-5</ref></char>), ndɛ otam bɔ k'akal lala ye baal bɛn k'adzii k'asal wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn owɛɛl baal obɔ áketsam ndiri lio li ntɔɔ em'etɔ.</para>
  <para style="io">Obɔ otsɛn bɛn Pool olieel ndiri: «Okɛɛn mbuul k'adzii k'asal wɛ, ndɛ hɛ̃ abee odza!» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:10">3.10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io">Pool bvool awa ãnkunkwa me baal b'abetsam ndiri okɛɛn mbuul wu oyii ɔ̃kiool, ebvaan ndɛ ayɔɔl k'asal onse ɔ̃kiri wu, bu ayii kɛn epwa-epwa, ki abesa pyɛ. Ɔ̃nkaan osɛn m'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl y'ɔ̃bio (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3.16-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Mɛ̃ wu Pool, ye Silibvɛ̃ ye Timote, bee eswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ol'ebvɔɔn li Afi-Tesalonik li Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="2TH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ nyiĩ, bvool awa byɛ opi!<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsiil b'ãndɔɔ b'ayɛɛl me tsoo li ekieel eya Mãsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Andoo, ebvaan bee ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn ãlio mbueel me ndɔɔ a byɛ, bvool eli ngesɛ kwɛn bee esa obobɔ, ke ngwel wɛ okiool o byɛ obeyi nkwel bvool dzii li eli a byɛ bueel me ndɔɔ a bakyɛ ebeluul kɛn oluul. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />M'emfa okyɛ, bee eli y'osia mpaa me ndɔɔ a byɛ onse ãbvɔɔn ã Nziã, me ndɔɔ osɛ-mwiĩ y'okiool o byɛ onse ãmpal m'abetuaal byɛ, bvool onse fool li ebekuru byɛ ɛ̃kwal onse lɔ. <verse eid="2TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ãmpal omɔ̃ ãsuo kwɛn Nziã abetsiil ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki dzu. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɔ̃ ãsa kwɛn byɛ ebvaan me ndɔɔ Okwɛn o Nziã b'ebemwɛn byɛ fool me ndɔɔ a bɔ. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã oli dzu: Ndɛ akieel abveel ãmpal me b'abetuaal byɛ mɔ̃. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Ndɛ bvool akieel asa kwɛn, byɛ b'ebemwɛn fool ewuun ye bee. Ndɛ akieel asa obobɔ ŋ'ekieel emɔɔn Mfam Yeso, fa ywel y'ãnzwel ã ndɛ mã waan. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Ndɛ akieel aya onse ɔ̃kaan a mbaa, me ndɔɔ yi awa etumbu me bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ ye bɛn k'alweel Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso wɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Bɔ akieel abɔɔ etumbu ki ebvaan me bɔ, etumbu ki ekieel ebiil bɔ ɔ̃bu, lala y'osu o Mfam, lala ye waan e lweel e ndɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãkieel ãbwel me tsoo li ekieel eya ndɛ, kwɛn ba ndɛ ba ngel, b'akiool ndɛ awa ndɛ dzuun bvool atuɛɛn ndɛ. Byɛ, byɛ ekieel ekal onse bɔ, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ ekiool Nsia yi étee bee byɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bee ebebuɛɛn ãlio mbueel me ndɔɔ a byɛ, kwɛn Nziã a bia-byɛ asa kwɛn byɛ edzuu m'emfa ki mbel yi éti ndɛ byɛ, bvool kwɛn me waan e ndɛ, ndɛ aluul byɛ m'efua kieel ki esa obvɛ, bvool asa kwɛn okiool o byɛ osa ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />M'emfa okyɛ, nkuũ a Mfam Yeso ebɔɔ lweel me byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ èbɔɔ lweel me ndɛ, m'emfa e nyiĩ a Nziã a bia-byɛ ye Mfam Yeso Mãsia.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel ye k'eya Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Andoo, me b'otal oya o Mfam Yeso Mãsia y'obvɔɔn o bia-byɛ ola ndɛ, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />okɛɛn mbuul olieel byɛ ndiri tsoo e Mfam emeetɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn tswa-tswa oŋɔ̃ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ɛ̃bee obii, bvool ebee buɔ oyoo. Akoo k'awa byɛ nsia oyɔ onge ãyɛɛn m'ãfi ola Nziã, wuo onge eyɛɛn ngemɔ̃, wuo onge ɔ̃nkaan wɛn ndiri wu ekel bee. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul abee byɛ opfuru m'emfa ke kyɛn. Ke ngwel wɛ, ye k'etɔ tsoo olɔ, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn ebvaan lio li etiɔ baal Nziã eboo eya, ebvaan bvool mbuul wu ɔ̃bi, ndɛ wu muaan wu odziɔɔn, amɔɔn. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Ndɛ ondɛ ɔ̃taal, wu akieel ayɛɛn obi m'eluɔ bvieel bvi ngel, eluɔ bvieel bvi ebelweel baal. Ndɛ akieel atɔ tiil k'oyebva o nsɛn onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bvool tiil k'abɛɛl ntwel ndiri ndɛ ndyam Nziã. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Byɛ k'eyeel wɛn, mɛ̃ ékeliaal byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ŋ'éli mɛ̃ kɛn ola byɛ wɛ? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Kɛn a byɛ eyɛɛ ki ebekii ndɛ nkuul meba, kwɛn ndɛ asuo nzuru kɛn a me lio e ndɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Ke ngwel wɛ, meba, waan li m'edziɔɔn li obi ebesa ɔ̃sal a lɔ. Kɛn a me lio lɛn wu abekii lɔ nkuul kieel k'abekal wɛ, oŋɔ̃ lɔ bu emɔɔn kal-a-kal. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Obobɔ, mbuul wu ɔ̃bi akieel amɔɔn, bvool Mfam Yeso akieel abam ndɛ m'ɔ̃fiaal wu ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ, ndɛ akieel anyam ndɛ me waan li oya o ndɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Mbuul wu ɔ̃bi ondɛ akieel apal me waan li Ɔ̃pfu, y'emvieel bvi emfa bvieel, y'eliĩ y'emwã bvi mfya. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />M'ɛ̃sal mvieel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi mi emfa bwɛn emfa, ndɛ akieel apfuru b'àdziɔɔn, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ abee dzii li otaa-taa li ekeebvuul wɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã oyuɔɔl bɔ waan e pfuru li esa kwɛn bɔ akiool ãndɔɔ mã mfya. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Ndɛ asa obobɔ kwɛn bueel b'abee otaa-taa okiool bvool adzii obi, abɔɔ etumbu.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osɛn b'ãnã onse okiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Me b'otal bee, andoo b'edzii Mfam, ebvaan ãlio mbueel bee ebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã osueel byɛ k'ekal baal b'ɛ̃kwel b'ebvuul me mpɛn a Ɔ̃fel, wu osi kwɛn byɛ ekal ba ngel, bvool m'okiool o byɛ b'elɔ byɛ onse otaa-taa. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Nziã áti byɛ mbel me ndɔɔ oyɔ me nkuul a Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi étee bee byɛ, kwɛn byɛ ebɔɔ lweel e Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Obobɔ, andoo, esɛn ãnã bvool ekuru nzuru m'ãtee m'etee bee byɛ, ekal m'ãyɛɛn, ekal m'ɔ̃nkaan. <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia ndyam ye Nziã wu Tal a bia-byɛ ádzii bia-byɛ, bvool me nyiĩ, áwi bia-byɛ mpɛn yi ɔ̃bu ye kaã li ngesɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />Yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ aluul ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ m'onzɔɔ̃! Yɔɔl kwɛn bɔ bvool awa byɛ mpɛn yi esa obvɛ ãlio mbueel, ekal m'ɛ̃sal, ekal m'ãyɛɛn mã ngesɛ!<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Luo me ndɔɔ ebuɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />M'osɛɛl, andoo, ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bee, kwɛn Endɔɔ e Mfam etsɔɔn tswa-tswa bvool ekal ye dzuun onge b'eli lɔ ye dzuun ola byɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Ebuɛɛn Nziã hɛ̃ kwɛn ndɛ abvuul bee me baal b'abi bvool bɛn otsɛn pyɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bueel k'ali y'okiool wɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Kɛn a Mfam oli wɛn ebvaan bia-byɛ eta kaã me ndɛ: Ndɛ akieel awa byɛ mpɛn bvool akwɛɛ byɛ lala ye Wu ɔ̃bi. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Bee eli ye kaã me Mfam me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛn, byɛ ebesa bvool ekieel esa m'etam bee byɛ osa. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam asa kwɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ɛ̃dzii Nziã bvool ɛ̃kal y'osɛ-mwiĩ o Mãsia.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluɛɛn o kuul e ntam Pool onse ɔ̃sal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Andoo, me nkuũ a Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia, bee etam byɛ k'ekal lala ye ndoo wueel wu akal epwa-epwa, bvool k'anɔɔn ãtee m'etee bee byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Byam eyɛɛ emfa ki eluɛɛn byɛ kuul e bee, ke ngwel wɛ bee k'edzuu epwa-epwa onse byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Bee k'edzi mampa a mbuul ngwel wɛ. Kɛn a tsia mwiĩ bee esi ɔ̃sal wa fool bvool wu efi ɔ̃furu, kwɛn bee ebee okal mpɛn me mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Bee ŋ'esi obobɔ, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ale k'ekoo m'owuaal a bee wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bee edzii k'esuo byɛ kuul li enɔɔn a byɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'éli bee ola byɛ, bee éwi byɛ ngel yi: «Okɛɛn mbuul k'adzii k'asal wɛ, ndɛ hɛ̃ abee odza!» <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Kɛn a bee eyoo wɛn onse byɛ, eli y'anga-obwal bɛn ki asa pyɛ, kɛn a bɔ ɔ̃sal wu abesam anga-ãndɔɔ. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Me baal ba m'emfa okyɛ, bee ewi bɔ luo, bvool etam bɔ me nkuũ a Mfam Yeso Mãsia k'asa bubu: Asal onse opi, kwɛn bɔ abɔɔ ki-adza ki efi m'ɔ̃sal a bam. <verse eid="2TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Me b'otal byɛ, andoo, ebee owɔɔl m'osa b'obvɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Okɛɛn mbuul k'alweel m'eyɛɛn bee onse ɔ̃nkaan wu wɛ, etal ndɔɔ oyɔ ngesɛ. Ebee y'ondoo ye ndɛ obekal, kwɛn ndɛ akwa opfuru. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Kɛn ebee ndɛ owal onge ɔ̃taal, edzuru ndɛ ãtswi onge b'abedzuru mã ndoo.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl y'ɔ̃bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam nga-opi ndyam awa byɛ opi lio lueel bvool m'emfa kieel! Yɔɔl Mfam akal ye byɛ bueel! <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Obio ba, bo me kuɔɔl e myam wu Pool. Eli eliĩ ki ebelɔ mɛ̃ m'ɛ̃nkaan mvieel, oyɔ hɛ̃ nke-nkel a mɛ̃. <verse eid="2TH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Yɔɔl kwɛn Mfam a bia-byɛ Yeso Mãsia asio byɛ bueel nyiĩ!<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>